import fs from 'node:fs/promises';import path from 'node:path';import os from 'node:os';import {fileURLToPath} from 'node:url';import {createHash} from 'node:crypto';import assert from 'node:assert/strict';import {runSketchChild} from './candidate/scripts/sketch-collector-process.mjs';
const here=path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)),stage=path.resolve(here,'../sketch-collector-next'),product=path.resolve(here,'../../outputs/rea-research-lab/products/rea-studio'),digest=b=>createHash('sha256').update(b).digest('hex'),sourceNames=['candidate/scripts/verify-sketch-geometry.mjs','candidate/scripts/sketch-collector-process.mjs','candidate/tests/sketch-collector.test.mjs','candidate/tests/fixtures/sketch-collector/runner.mjs','candidate/tests/fixtures/sketch-collector/descendant.mjs','prepare-adapter.mjs','verify-adapter.mjs','adaptation.json','README.md'];
async function fingerprints(folder,names){const rows=[];for(const name of names){const b=await fs.readFile(path.join(folder,name));rows.push({path:name,bytes:b.length,sha256:digest(b)});}return rows;}
async function inventory(folder,prefix=''){const names=[];for(const item of await fs.readdir(folder,{withFileTypes:true})){assert.ok(!item.isSymbolicLink());if(item.isDirectory())names.push(...await inventory(path.join(folder,item.name),prefix+item.name+'/'));else names.push(prefix+item.name);}return names.sort();}
